oplite shield  in the game in the background there are  a few more easter eggs  there's longbow ulan the black phantom  form of phalanx who  used to attack from behind the legion's  shields and there's also two  familiar dragons gliding over the castle  the overall design  is inspired by those super retro movie  posters that had  really striking text and sort of solid  colors and because of this it looks  great in all sizes on display  with a matte or glossy finish whatever  you like this plate also chose this  design for their limited edition program  so for a limited time starting thursday  the 19th midnight at cet  you can buy a version of this print that  has been enhanced with selective gloss  finish  special ink and unique frames it  actually looks incredible i'm super  impressed but you're gonna have to act  quick if you want  this version because they're only making  200 and displayed club members will get  access to it 24 hours early  if they've bought from display  previously with the link in the  description you'll get 33  off if you're buying this display but  the more you add to your cart  the bigger your discount gets so  consider picking up  convergence the painted world or future  souls as well  i have a whole collection now which is  cool and working on this stuff is a huge  passion for me so  thank you for supporting it thank you  for watching enjoy the animations  and i'll see you next time  um  [Music]  um  um  you
 

